{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1137823-books-on-supernatural-stuff-do-people-keep-them-on-their-tablets-and-e-readersd","id":1137823,"title":"Books on Supernatural stuff, do people keep them on their Tablets and E readersd?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-05T14:21:23-07:00","id":1137823,"title":"Books on Supernatural stuff, do people keep them on their Tablets and E readersd?","content":"technology has revolutionized society.<br /> <br /> used to I could get weird glances for taking a D&amp;D book to the library<br /> <br /> and didnt even think of taking a playboy in public.<br /> <br /> now... people dont know on the bus how much of my time, in public I spend reading Erotica.<br /> <br /> Do you think most Supernaturals, would see keeping a book like the silver record, on ones E reader as an acceptable risk?<br /> <br /> <br /> or think they'd see too much potential for a breach?<br /> <br /> think publishers would see that as dilluting things? especialy the silver record?<br /> <br /> oh on the silver record just show carvings? so no one knows what the glyph means?<br /> <br /> or book of Nod in enochian.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 09-05-2017, 07:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-06T11:21:46-07:00","id":1138054,"title":"","content":"The Glass Walkers would do it, yes. Probably with spiritually enhanced encryption. <br /> <br /> The Virtual Adepts are pretty much centered around digital grimoires. And by the year 2000, the Sons of Ether's Paradigma more than likely has an online edition. It's up to you if either group has figured out how to do quantum encryption, though. <br /> <br /> As for vampires, if Deacon Frost was doing it with sacred texts in <i>Blade</i>, then Kindred have probably been doing it just as long. I think there are even entire groups of Tremere and Assamites who do that sort of thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-06T14:19:28-07:00","id":1138109,"title":"","content":"Just thought think spiritualy enhanced encryption would be enough to hide the fact their was an obfuscated file? <br /> <br /> If the device was searched say by police?<br /> <br /> or tell it to self destruct in such circumstances?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-07T06:13:11-07:00","id":1138299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just thought think spiritualy enhanced encryption would be enough to hide the fact their was an obfuscated file? <br /> <br /> If the device was searched say by police?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depending on how the magic works, police may think there's something hidden or not (the file may well be invisible to those that haven't spirit sight)...but whatever the case, police hasn't magical resources (exept when it has, of course, like when a Splat works there). Without spiritual magic of some kind one can't decipher spiritual speech, much less spiritual encryption.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> or tell it to self destruct in such circumstances? </div> </div> </div>Since only supernaturals will be able to steal your data, this should be a measure to counter other supernaturals stealing the data. <br /> <br /> Paranoid mages may put any sort of nasty traps in their virtual files, from auto-destruct to about anything you can imagine: For instance, I a virus that erases your memory, cleansing all knowledge about the supernatural world you have, it's doable .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-07T10:17:00-07:00","id":1138348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1137823-books-on-supernatural-stuff-do-people-keep-them-on-their-tablets-and-e-readersd?p=1138109#post1138109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just thought think spiritualy enhanced encryption would be enough to hide the fact their was an obfuscated file?<br /> <br /> If the device was searched say by police?<br /> <br /> or tell it to self destruct in such circumstances?</div> </div> </div> </div>In Werewolf? Yes. It could be anything from a chameleon spirit pretending to be a completely different file to some sort of tamed Weaver spider that orders the unawakened data spirits to &quot;go away/ignore this&quot;. Unless the outside user trying to break the encryption has access to spiritually awakened technology (another Garou or some sort of cyber-shaman), they aren't going to make much headway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-07T11:18:38-07:00","id":1138355,"title":"","content":"What about CoG, Fianna, Silver Fangs, Shadow Lords? not quite as tech savvy as glasswalkers but not as tech hating as Talons.<br /> <br /> I could see some Ritualists taking notes to help them remember a rarely performed rite on their Tablet, but probaly not having it out during the rite.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img